text:
Reading new novelists for the Compton Crook Award is some of the fun in being a member of @balticon.bsky.social 

Best wishes to all of this year's finalists.

@eirencaffall.bsky.social, Haley Gefulso, Antonia Hodgson, @barsukov.com, @mhayinde.bsky.social & Andrew Luddington

Rachel Louise Adams's debut, NO REST FOR THE WICKED. A sharp, melancholic study of a woman who can read a dead body but can't decipher her own family. A forensic pathologist must dig up the past in a town that's buried its secrets deep. 

@titanbooks.bsky.social 

